Hence  a,  /3,  7  combine  according  to  the  laws  of  the  quaternion  symbols  i,  j,  k ;  and
it  is  only  the  point  of  view  from  which  the  question  is  here  considered  which  obliges
us  to  consider  the  symbols  as  belonging  to  a  group  of  8,  instead  of  (as  in  the  theory
